# Architecture

Purpose:
  System architecture knowledge base. Defines architecture levels,
  patterns, principles, scaling, availability, data, observability,
  networking, and deployment rules.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1 @INDEX.sdd
   2 @architecture.sdd
   3 @levels.sdd
   4 @patterns.sdd
   5 @principles.sdd
   6 @scaling.sdd
   7 @availability.sdd
   8 @data.sdd
   9 @observability.sdd
   10 @networking.sdd
   11 @deployment.sdd

Rules:
  [AR1] Architecture MUST be defined before implementation.
  [AR2] Architecture patterns MUST be documented.
  [AR3] Scaling rules MUST be defined for L3+ systems.
  [AR4] Availability targets MUST be explicit.
  [AR5] Data architecture MUST include storage, flow, and retention.

